# CineSync Environment Variables
# ==============================
# These are SERVER-SIDE ONLY. Never import these in frontend code.
# Vite (the frontend bundler) only exposes vars prefixed with VITE_.
# Since ours are NOT prefixed with VITE_, they stay on the server.

